## Original Content
Топливо в среду поступит в свободную продажу и по QR-кодам в Севастополе на АЗС одной сети, сообщил губернатор города Михаил Развожаев."Продажа четырех видов топлива (Аи-95, Аи-95 NP, Аи-92 и ДТ) на АЗС "ТЭС" будет осуществляться по QR-кодам.

## Summary
Fuel in Sevastopol will be available for both free sale and via QR codes starting Wednesday at gas stations of a specific chain, as announced by Governor Mikhail Razvozhaev. Four types of fuel (AI-95, AI-95 NP, AI-92, and diesel) will be sold through QR codes at 'TES' gas stations.

## Key Points
- Fuel sales in Sevastopol will include QR code options starting Wednesday.
- Governor Mikhail Razvozhaev announced the change in fuel sales methods.
- Four specific fuel types (AI-95, AI-95 NP, AI-92, and diesel) will be available via QR codes.
- The implementation applies to gas stations of one chain, 'TES'.
- The move aims to facilitate fuel distribution using QR code technology.


